# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# DDLsmith line-ending policy
#
# Every text file is stored and checked out as LF, which is what the working
# tree already uses. This is stated here rather than left to core.autocrlf
# (set to true on this machine) so that a clone on any platform produces
# identical bytes. LF is handled correctly by pwsh, Windows PowerShell, the
# JDK and Maven, so no file needs a special case.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets are never converted.
*.jar binary
*.db binary
*.duckdb binary
*.zip binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.pdf binary
